partcad-collection-openusd-usd-wg
=================================

This PartCAD package serves the USD Working Group's assets as PartCAD parts.

The code in this repository (the `usd_wg_repo.py` repository plugin, the shared
`usd_assets.py`, the PartCAD configuration and the tests) is:

    Copyright 2026 PartCAD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

No asset is included in this repository. The assets, their layers and their
textures are fetched on demand from https://github.com/usd-wg/assets, and
remain their contributors', each under the licence its readme gives - CC0,
CC BY 4.0, CC BY-SA 4.0, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for McUsd - and otherwise under that
repository's Apache License 2.0.

OpenUSD and the Academy Software Foundation's marks are their owners'. This
package is not affiliated with or endorsed by the USD Working Group.
